{"id":64,"slug":"64-aria-live-dung-khi-nao","category":"HTML","subcategory":"Accessibility","level":"advanced","question_vi":"aria-live dùng khi nào?","question_en":"When should you use aria-live?","answer_vi":"`aria-live` báo cho screen reader biết một vùng **sẽ thay đổi nội dung sau khi trang đã tải**, để nó đọc lên mà không cần người dùng di chuyển focus tới đó.\n\n```html\n<!-- polite: đợi screen reader nói hết câu hiện tại rồi mới đọc -->\n<div aria-live=\"polite\" id=\"status\"></div>\n\n<!-- assertive: cắt ngang, dùng cho lỗi nghiêm trọng -->\n<div aria-live=\"assertive\" id=\"error\"></div>\n\n<!-- role=\"alert\" = aria-live=\"assertive\" + aria-atomic=\"true\" -->\n<p role=\"alert\">Phiên đăng nhập đã hết hạn</p>\n```\n\n```js\nstatus.textContent = 'Đã lưu 3 thay đổi'   // screen reader tự đọc\n```\n\n| Giá trị | Khi nào |\n|---|---|\n| `off` | mặc định, không đọc |\n| `polite` | trạng thái, kết quả tìm kiếm, \"đã lưu\", tin nhắn mới |\n| `assertive` | lỗi chặn thao tác, cảnh báo hết phiên |\n\n**Lưu ý 1:** vùng live phải **có sẵn trong DOM từ đầu**, chỉ nội dung bên trong đổi. Thêm cả `<div aria-live>` vào DOM cùng lúc với nội dung thì nhiều screen reader **không đọc gì**.\n\n**Lưu ý 2:** lạm dụng `assertive` khiến người dùng bị ngắt liên tục và mất mạch — mặc định nên là `polite`","answer_en":"`aria-live` tells a screen reader that a region **will change after page load**, so it announces the update without the user moving focus there.\n\n```html\n<!-- polite: waits until the current utterance finishes -->\n<div aria-live=\"polite\" id=\"status\"></div>\n\n<!-- assertive: interrupts; reserve it for serious errors -->\n<div aria-live=\"assertive\" id=\"error\"></div>\n\n<!-- role=\"alert\" = aria-live=\"assertive\" + aria-atomic=\"true\" -->\n<p role=\"alert\">Your session has expired</p>\n```\n\n```js\nstatus.textContent = '3 changes saved'   // announced automatically\n```\n\n| Value | When |\n|---|---|\n| `off` | default, never announced |\n| `polite` | status, search results, \"saved\", new messages |\n| `assertive` | blocking errors, session-expiry warnings |\n\n**Note 1:** the live region must **already exist in the DOM**, with only its contents changing. Inserting the `<div aria-live>` together with its content leaves many screen readers **silent**.\n\n**Note 2:** overusing `assertive` interrupts the user constantly and breaks their train of thought — `polite` should be the default","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>aria-live</code> báo cho screen reader biết một vùng <strong>sẽ thay đổi nội dung sau khi trang đã tải</strong>, để nó đọc lên mà không cần người dùng di chuyển focus tới đó.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- polite: đợi screen reader nói hết câu hiện tại rồi mới đọc --&gt;\n&lt;div aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; id=&quot;status&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- assertive: cắt ngang, dùng cho lỗi nghiêm trọng --&gt;\n&lt;div aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; id=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- role=&quot;alert&quot; = aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; + aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot; --&gt;\n&lt;p role=&quot;alert&quot;&gt;Phiên đăng nhập đã hết hạn&lt;/p&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- polite: đợi screen reader nói hết câu hiện tại rồi mới đọc --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-live</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;polite&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;status&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- assertive: cắt ngang, dùng cho lỗi nghiêm trọng --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-live</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;assertive&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;error&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- role=&quot;alert&quot; = aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; + aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot; --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;alert&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Phiên đăng nhập đã hết hạn<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"status.textContent = 'Đã lưu 3 thay đổi'   // screen reader tự đọc\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">status.<span class=\"hljs-property\">textContent</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Đã lưu 3 thay đổi&#x27;</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// screen reader tự đọc</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th>Giá trị</th><th>Khi nào</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>off</code></td><td>mặc định, không đọc</td></tr><tr><td><code>polite</code></td><td>trạng thái, kết quả tìm kiếm, \"đã lưu\", tin nhắn mới</td></tr><tr><td><code>assertive</code></td><td>lỗi chặn thao tác, cảnh báo hết phiên</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Lưu ý 1:</strong> vùng live phải <strong>có sẵn trong DOM từ đầu</strong>, chỉ nội dung bên trong đổi. Thêm cả <code>&lt;div aria-live&gt;</code> vào DOM cùng lúc với nội dung thì nhiều screen reader <strong>không đọc gì</strong>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý 2:</strong> lạm dụng <code>assertive</code> khiến người dùng bị ngắt liên tục và mất mạch — mặc định nên là <code>polite</code>.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>aria-live</code> tells a screen reader that a region <strong>will change after page load</strong>, so it announces the update without the user moving focus there.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- polite: waits until the current utterance finishes --&gt;\n&lt;div aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; id=&quot;status&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- assertive: interrupts; reserve it for serious errors --&gt;\n&lt;div aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; id=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- role=&quot;alert&quot; = aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; + aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot; --&gt;\n&lt;p role=&quot;alert&quot;&gt;Your session has expired&lt;/p&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- polite: waits until the current utterance finishes --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-live</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;polite&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;status&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- assertive: interrupts; reserve it for serious errors --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-live</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;assertive&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;error&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- role=&quot;alert&quot; = aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; + aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot; --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;alert&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Your session has expired<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"status.textContent = '3 changes saved'   // announced automatically\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">status.<span class=\"hljs-property\">textContent</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;3 changes saved&#x27;</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// announced automatically</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th>Value</th><th>When</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>off</code></td><td>default, never announced</td></tr><tr><td><code>polite</code></td><td>status, search results, \"saved\", new messages</td></tr><tr><td><code>assertive</code></td><td>blocking errors, session-expiry warnings</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Note 1:</strong> the live region must <strong>already exist in the DOM</strong>, with only its contents changing. Inserting the <code>&lt;div aria-live&gt;</code> together with its content leaves many screen readers <strong>silent</strong>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note 2:</strong> overusing <code>assertive</code> interrupts the user constantly and breaks their train of thought — <code>polite</code> should be the default.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — ARIA live regions","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility/ARIA/Guides/Live_regions"},{"label":"W3C APG — Alert pattern","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/alert/"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/3-the-doctype-la-gi-tai-sao-can-khai-bao-doctype","title":"Thẻ DOCTYPE là gì? Tại sao cần khai báo DOCTYPE?"},{"url":"/q/4-cau-truc-co-ban-cua-mot-tai-lieu-html-bao-gom-nhung-gi","title":"Cấu trúc cơ bản của một tài liệu HTML bao gồm những gì?"},{"url":"/q/8-block-level-element-va-inline-element-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao-trong-html","title":"Block-level element và Inline element khác nhau như thế nào trong HTML?"},{"url":"/q/12-html-attribute-thuoc-tinh-la-gi-cho-vi-du","title":"HTML Attribute (thuộc tính) là gì? Cho ví dụ?"},{"url":"/q/13-boolean-attribute-trong-html-la-gi-cho-vi-du","title":"Boolean attribute trong HTML là gì? Cho ví dụ?"},{"url":"/q/14-custom-data-attribute-data-trong-html-la-gi","title":"Custom data attribute (data-*) trong HTML là gì?"},{"url":"/q/15-thuoc-tinh-id-va-class-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Thuộc tính `id` và `class` khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/16-semantic-html-la-gi-tai-sao-quan-trong","title":"Semantic HTML là gì? Tại sao quan trọng?"}]}